# Kept OUT of the Cloudflare upload (Workers static assets reads this file).
#
# The admin panel is served by the WorkBuddy cloud service and only accepts calls
# from its own origin (https://gficcrew.app.workbuddy.host). Rendered from
# gficcrew.com it would load a shell that cannot talk to its backend — a page that
# looks alive but does nothing. A plain 404 is the honest answer, same intent as
# the RedirectMatch rule in .htaccess for the China site.
#
# Content management stays at https://gficcrew.app.workbuddy.host/admin/
admin/

# The admin page's own CSS/JS chunks (hashed names, so matched as a glob).
# Nothing else references them — verified by grepping dist-global.
_astro/admin.*

# The China bundle is not needed here; the BT server pulls it from the WorkBuddy
# host, and shipping it to Cloudflare would just add half a megabyte per deploy.
cn-bundle.txt
